<title>USA: ATC Group Services Q2 shr up to $0.25.</title>
<headline>ATC Group Services Q2 shr up to $0.25.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996  Q2		 1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.25		    $0.18</p>
<p> Net		 2,101		    1,519</p>
<p> Revs		33,922		   11,649</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  8,628		    6,332</p>
<p>		   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.44		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net		 3,819		    2,414</p>
<p> Revs		50,568		   22,464</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  8,576		    6,542</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is ATC Group Services Inc, formerly ATC Environmental Inc.</p>
<p>Q2 figures ended August 31</p>
<p>Q2 net income includes one-time tax benefit of $350,000, or $0.5 per share, from the merger of Aurora Environmental Inc.</p>
<p>Higher figures for Q2 due to earnings accretion from acquisition of assets of ATEC Associates Inc and 3D Information Systems Inc in May.</p>
</text>
